All statements are SELECT private.helper(...) with explicit ::uuid, ::text or ::jsonb arguments. Serialize JSON, escape each backslash as two and each apostrophe as two inside an E''...'' SQL string, reject NUL characters; then cast ::jsonb. No interpolated unescaped web content. Available signatures: private.begin_opportunity_search(uuid,uuid); private.refresh_opportunity_search_protocol(uuid); private.save_opportunity_search_queries(uuid,jsonb); private.submit_opportunity_search_result(uuid,uuid,jsonb); private.verify_opportunity_search_result(uuid,uuid); private.complete_opportunity_search(uuid,jsonb); private.read_opportunity_search_run(uuid); private.claim_opportunity_search_schedule(uuid,uuid); private.confirm_opportunity_search_schedule(uuid,uuid,text,jsonb).
